Goon Squad Galaxy Simulator
Commands:
  help | quit(q) | end(e)
  Deploy: dN or d N (e.g. d0) | Double deploy: ddN
           Add contributors after the command, e.g. d0 0 1 1
  View: deadpool (dp)
  Pay wind: pay <amount> p1|p2:idx[,idx]
  Use ability: u <src> <abil>
    Target shorthand: uN A>targets (enemy) or uN A<targets (ally); example: u2 
0>3 4
  Inspect cards: vh hand card, vb board card, vo opponent board
  AI assist: ai 
Turn and game summaries print automatically after each end of turn.
Start flags: --ai p1|p2|both (auto-turns for AI), --auto
See: gamerules.md
Tip: Type ai to have the current player act once.
Use ai p1 or ai p2 to target a side.
Deploy with dN (you can list contributors: e.g. d0 0 1 1); end turn with e or 
end.
